Z||000011||Tina||07-04-2001||12:12 PM||||Well hopefully the thing is gone by now, but just for good measure I would try the water or spray idea. Perhaps both.<BR>The last thing you want happening, is that critter nibbeling on your wires.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Tina||||reg||1
